{ If black trades on f3, white recaptures with the queen and continues. } 9.
Qxf3 { Queen takes on f3 after the trade. } ) 9. g4
{ G4, attacking the bishop further. Remember g4-f5 is a version of the Noah's Arc trap if the bishop goes back. }
9... Bg6 { Black's bishop retreats to g6. } 10. f5
{ F5! Bishop on g6 is now trapped. This is the Noah's Arc trap variation. After castling and chasing the bishop, the queen comes out to a nice square and white has a great position to launch pawns forward and attack. }
